2. Definitions.– (1) In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a) ‘‘Act’’ means the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013);
(b) ‘‘Annexure’’ means the Annexure to these rules;
(c) “Form” or “e-Form” means a form in the electronic form or non-
electronic form as specified under the Act or Rules made there under
and notified by the Central Government under the Act;
(d) ‘‘Fees’’ means fees as specified in the Companies (Registration
offices and fees) Rules, 2014;
